Sample Project Documentation
1. Project Title

Script-Controlled ACL – Restrict Record Access Based on Field Value

2. Project Objective

To provide secure and controlled access to institution records using ServiceNow ACLs.

3. Problem

Unauthorized users may access or modify records that they are not permitted to use.

4. Proposed Solution

A Script-Controlled ACL mechanism is implemented to control record access based on user roles and the Branch field.

5. Technology Used
ServiceNow
Access Control Lists
JavaScript
ServiceNow Roles
Custom Table
6. Implementation

Users, roles, the Institution Details table, and separate ACLs are configured in ServiceNow.

7. Testing

READ, CREATE, WRITE, DELETE, unauthorized access, and administrator access are tested.

8. Outcome

The project provides controlled access to institution records and prevents unauthorized operations.
